<div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Ceiling_temperatures">Ceiling temperatures</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Steric_effects&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section: Ceiling temperatures"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p><a href="/wiki/Ceiling_temperature" title="Ceiling temperature">Ceiling temperature</a> (<span class="mwe-math-element"><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"  alttext="{\displaystyle T_{c}}">
